Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回到刚才那个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Back to our puzzle:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.45,0:00:05.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个项目，两个版本的 httpx，却只有一层公用的架子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}two projects, two versions of httpx, one shared shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.89,0:00:09.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,解决办法是给每个项目一个自己的工具箱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix is to give each project its own toolbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:11.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个工具箱，就是虚拟环境\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That toolbox is a virtual environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:17.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,虚拟环境其实就是一个目录，名字通常是 .venv，分三个部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A virtual environment is just a folder, usually called .venv, with three parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:20.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一，一个 bin 目录，里面有个 python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, a bin folder with a python inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.01,0:00:25.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它通常不是拷贝，只是个软链接，指向别处真正的解释器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's usually not a copy, just a link to a real interpreter somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:30.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二，它自己的 site-packages 目录，uv 刚建好时是空的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Second, its own site-packages folder, empty when uv makes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:35.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一般叫 site-packages；Debian 把系统的叫 dist-packages\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Site-packages is the usual name; Debian calls its system ones dist-packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:40.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个项目的包就装在这里，而且只装这个项目的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This is where this project's packages go, and only this project's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:44.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三，一个小配置文件：pyvenv.cfg\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Third, a small config file, pyvenv.cfg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:48.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Python 从 venv 的 bin 目录启动时，会读这个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When Python starts from the venv's bin folder, it reads this file.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:53.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它说：你在 venv 里，所以用我的 site-packages，系统的不算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It says: you're in a venv, so use my site-packages, and leave the system's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看看架子上的区别\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's the difference on the shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 venv 启动的 Python，建出的列表不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Started from the venv, Python builds a different list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:03.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,标准库还是来自它软链接指向的那个真正的解释器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The standard library still comes from the real interpreter it links to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:07.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但系统的两层 dist-packages 架子都没了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But both dist-packages shelves from the system are gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.22,0:01:09.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,换成 venv 自己的那层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the venv's own shelf takes their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:12.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,引擎还是那个引擎，工具箱换了一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same engine, different toolbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:14.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且两个工具箱互不相干\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the toolboxes don't mix:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:19.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,venv 里的包，系统 Python 看不见，反过来也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}packages in the venv are invisible to the system Python, and the other way round.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.63,0:01:21.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还记得 pip 的提示吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember pip's hint?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:25.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它建议用 python3 -m venv，这是建 venv 的经典做法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It suggested python3 -m venv, the classic way to make one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:28.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天用 uv 来建，它还能做更多\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today, uv makes it for us, and does a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.13,0:01:35.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有些东西 venv 隔离不了：操作系统、用 C 写的系统库，还有驱动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What a venv doesn't isolate: the operating system, system libraries written in C, and drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.87,0:01:39.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些要交给一整台机器，比如我们的 VM\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those are jobs for a whole machine, like our VM,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,或者交给容器，下节课再讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}or a container, next lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:45.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑完 uv sync，我们打开真正的目录，找齐这三个部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}After uv sync, we'll open the real folder and find all three parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:52.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分换一台全新的 VM，设置不变，计价器又开始跳了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 starts on a fresh VM, same settings, and the meter runs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:56.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全新很重要：pip 从来没碰过这个系统 Python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fresh matters: this system Python never sees pip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:57.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,建好后 SSH 进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Create it and SSH in;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.91,0:02:03.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,名称被占用的话，说明旧 VM 还在删除，等一分钟就好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if the name is taken, the old VM is still being deleted, so wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:05.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停视频，等你的终端打开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause until your terminal is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:11.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着还是那四条：apt-get update、装 git、clone 和 cd\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the same four commands: apt-get update, install git, clone, and cd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:14.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停视频，直到提示符以 simple-translate 结尾\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause until your prompt ends in simple-translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:17.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 7 步一行命令就能装好 uv\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 7 installs uv in one line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:20.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先用 curl 下载一个脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, curl downloads a script:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:23.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会跟随重定向，安静运行但仍然显示错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it follows redirects, stays quiet but shows errors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:28.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,遇到 HTTP 错误就直接失败，而不是把错误页面交给 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and fails on an HTTP error instead of handing an error page to the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:33.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这根竖线是管道：它把脚本直接交给 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The vertical bar is a pipe: it hands the script straight to the shell,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:37.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以你运行的是网上来的代码，也就是 uv 的官方安装脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so you're running code from the internet: uv's official installer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:39.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你可以先读一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which you can read first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:41.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:46.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会装上 uv，录制时的版本是 0.13.0，还有 uvx\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It installs uv, version 0.13.0 at the time of recording,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:51.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都装到你 home 目录下的 .local/bin 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and uvx, into .local/bin in your home folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:53.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,试一下 uv，这是个额外检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Let's try uv, with an extra check.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,报 command not found\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Command not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:57.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可我们明明刚装好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But we just installed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.47,0:03:01.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你输入一个命令，shell 就去一个叫 PATH 的目录列表里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When you type a command, the shell walks a list of folders called PATH,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从左到右找，运行第一个匹配的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}left to right, and runs the first match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:08.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪个目录都没有 uv，而 shell 只认它启动时的 PATH\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}None contains uv, and the shell only knows the PATH it started with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:12.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,安装脚本最后几行和第 8 步给了两个办法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The installer's last lines, and step 8, give two options:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:15.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,重新加载 shell，或者 source env 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}reload your shell, or source the env file.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:19.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,重新加载就是新开一个 SSH 窗口，回到 home 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A reload means a new SSH window, back in your home folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:22.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以要重新 cd 进 simple-translate\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so you'd cd into simple-translate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:26.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 source 更快：它把那个目录放到 PATH 最前面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Sourcing is quicker: it puts that folder first in PATH.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:28.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍 source 那条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run the source line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:34.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再做两个额外检查：uv 能报出版本，which uv 也指向那个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then two extra checks: uv reports its version, and which uv points into that folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:36.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么用 source，不用 sh？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why source, and not sh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:40.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,直接用 sh，改的是马上就退出的子 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Plain sh would change a child shell that exits at once;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:42.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,source 改的是当前这个 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}source changes this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:46.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,安装脚本还让你的启动文件运行这个 env 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The installer also made your startup files run this env file,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:50.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以下次连上来，直接就能找到 uv\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so next time you connect, uv is found by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:52.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那 uv 到底是什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So what is uv?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:56.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个很快的工具，顶替好几个：venv 模块和 pip\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One fast tool that replaces several: the venv module,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:04:00.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,锁版本的 pip-tools，装 Python 的 pyenv，还有 pipx\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pip, pip-tools for locking, pyenv for installing Pythons, and pipx.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:03.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 9 步是 uv sync\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 9 is uv sync,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:08.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会读 pyproject.toml，所以我们先来读一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and it reads pyproject.toml, so let's read it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:09.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,项目名是 app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The name is app.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:17.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个依赖：art，6.5 及以上；googletrans，正好是 4.0.2\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two dependencies: art, version 6.5 or newer, and googletrans, exactly 4.0.2.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:21.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,大于等于表示一个范围；双等号表示一个确定的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Greater-or-equal means a range; double equals, one version.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:25.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 行又是一个范围：Python 3.13 及以上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 6 is a range again: Python 3.13 or newer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先预测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:29.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这台 VM 上是 Python 3.11\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This VM has Python 3.11.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.28,0:04:33.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,项目要求 3.13 及以上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The project asks for 3.13 or newer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那 uv sync 会怎么做？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What will uv sync do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:38.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,直接失败，照样用 3.11，还是做点别的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fail, use 3.11 anyway, or something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:49.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍 uv sync\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run uv sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:53.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它没有失败，而是下载了 uv 自己的 Python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Instead of failing, uv downloads its own Python:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:57.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CPython 3.15.0，这是录制时的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CPython 3.15.0, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:05:01.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后它在 .venv 里建了一个虚拟环境\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it creates a virtual environment in .venv.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.35,0:05:06.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果 uv 找不到 pyproject.toml，先 cd 进 simple-translate\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If uv can't find a pyproject.toml, cd into simple-translate first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来看看刚才发生了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:11.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 Python 的各个版本画在一条数轴上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Picture Python versions on a number line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:15.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个约束点亮了从 3.13 往后的所有版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The constraint lights up everything from 3.13 onward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:21.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,首先，uv 会找它已经有的解释器：先找自己下载过的，再找系统的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, uv looks for an interpreter it already has: its own downloads, then the system's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:26.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Debian 的 3.11.2 落在范围外面，所以用不了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Debian's 3.11.2 lands outside the range, so it can't be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:29.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 uv 要下载一个。下载哪一个呢？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So uv downloads one. Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:37.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是 3.13，而是范围内最新的版本，我们录制时是 3.15.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Not 3.13, but the newest release in the range, which was 3.15.0 when we recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它装在你 home 目录下 uv 自己的目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It lives in uv's own folder in your home,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:42.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,venv 的 python 就软链接到它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the venv's python links to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:45.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,问题就在这儿：约束不是 pin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the catch: a constraint is not a pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:51.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Python 3.15 出来之前，同样这条命令装的是 3.14\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before Python 3.15 came out, this same command gave people 3.14.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:55.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,明年再看这个视频的话，你拿到的可能是更新的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Watch this video next year, and you may get something newer still.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.55,0:05:58.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到了 Debian 13，情况就不一样了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On Debian 13, the story changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:03.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的系统 Python 是 3.13.5，本来就在范围里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its system Python, 3.13.5, is already inside the range.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:06.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 uv 直接用它，不用下载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So uv simply uses it, with no download,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.57,0:06:09.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,venv 的 python 就软链接到系统的那个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the venv's python links to the system one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:12.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同一条命令，不同的 Debian，不同的 Python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same command, different Debian, different Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:15.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想在哪儿都用同一个 Python，就把它 pin 住\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To get the same Python everywhere, pin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:20.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条命令是 uv python pin 3.13，README 里没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The command uv python pin 3.13, not in the README,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:23.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会写一个小文件，叫 .python-version\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}writes a small file called .python-version,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:27.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,范围就缩小到 3.13 系列\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the range shrinks to the 3.13 series.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.62,0:06:31.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在先别跑：下次 uv sync 会重建 venv\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Don't run it now: your next uv sync would rebuild the venv,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:33.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,视频后面的内容就对不上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the rest of the video wouldn't match.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:35.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个放在练习里了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's in the exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.57,0:06:38.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来看包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:42.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先出个小题：pyproject.toml 列了 2 个依赖\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A quick puzzle: pyproject.toml lists 2 dependencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:46.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一部分里，pip 为它们装了 12 个包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and in part 1, pip installed 12 packages for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:48.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那 uv 会装几个？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How many will uv install?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:57.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是 11 个：比第一部分少一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's 11: one fewer than part 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:03.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,解析了 13 个，装了 11 个，每个都带一个加号和精确版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It resolved 13 and installed 11, each with a plus sign and an exact version.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:06.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另外 9 个从哪儿来，少的又是哪一个？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So where did the other 9 come from, and which one went missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.18,0:07:12.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,包自己也有依赖；这条额外的命令，uv tree，会把它们画出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Packages have dependencies of their own; this extra command, uv tree, draws them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:17.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的 googletrans 需要 httpx，一个 HTTP 库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our googletrans needs httpx, an HTTP library,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:22.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它又需要 anyio、certifi、httpcore、h2，还有更多\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which needs anyio, certifi, httpcore, h2, and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.03,0:07:24.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个愿望，长成了一棵树\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two wishes grow into a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:29.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所谓解析，就是给依赖树里的每个包选定一个精确版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Resolving means choosing one exact version for every package in the tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:31.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且这些版本要彼此兼容\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}versions that all fit together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:38.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 uv 把它们写进一个新文件 uv.lock，连同下载地址和校验和\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then uv writes them to a new file, uv.lock, with download addresses and checksums.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:41.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 pyproject.toml 文件是你的愿望清单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The pyproject.toml file is your wish list.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.77,0:07:44.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 uv.lock 文件是购物小票\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The uv.lock file is the receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:46.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那为什么解析了 13 个？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So why 13 resolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:51.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是 11 个包，加上这个应用本身，uv 不用下载它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's 11 packages, plus the app itself, which uv doesn't download.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:53.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 13 个在 uv.lock 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The 13th is in uv.lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:58.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它覆盖了项目允许的每一个 Python，不只是我们这个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which covers every Python the project allows, not just ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:01.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,文件里写着，anyio 需要 typing-extensions\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In it, anyio needs typing-extensions,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:04.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但只在低于 3.15 的 Python 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but only on Python older than 3.15.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:07.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在我们的 3.15 上跳过了，所以是 11 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On our 3.15, it's skipped, so 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:12.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一部分是 Python 3.11，所以 pip 装了它：12 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 1 ran on Python 3.11, so pip installed it: 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:18.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 Debian 13 用的是 Python 3.13，uv 也装了 12 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And on Debian 13, with Python 3.13, uv installs 12 too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:20.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再说说小票为什么重要\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's why the receipt matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:23.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个同学隔一周各跑一次 uv sync\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two students run uv sync a week apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:29.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有共用的 lock 文件，各自从头解析，树的深处就可能版本不同\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without a shared lock, each resolves fresh and may get different versions deep in the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:33.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有了同一个 uv.lock，他们拿到的包就完全一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With the same uv.lock, they get exactly the same packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:35.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个额外检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extra checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:41.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一，ls -a 显示多了两样东西：.venv 目录和 uv.lock\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, ls -a shows two new things: the .venv folder, and uv.lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:44.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 git status 说，uv.lock 还没被跟踪\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And git status says uv.lock is untracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:47.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是这里生成的，不是 repo 自带的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It was made here; it didn't come with the repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:51.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里 README 有一个小错误，改起来很简单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now, a small mistake in the README, with an easy fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:55.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它说 uv.lock 能让下一个人拿到相同的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It says uv.lock gives the next person the same versions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:57.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但这个 repo 从没 commit 过它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But the repo never committed one,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:09:00.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以大家第一次 sync 都是从头解析\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so each student's first sync resolves fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:03.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自己的项目里，记得 commit uv.lock\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In your own projects, commit uv.lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:07.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自动化构建里，给 uv sync 加上 --locked 参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In automated builds, run uv sync with the --locked flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:10.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,lock 文件缺失或过期就拒绝执行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which refuses a missing or stale lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:13.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后再加一个额外步骤：重新跑一遍 uv sync\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last, an extra: run uv sync again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:16.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它检查同样的包，这里是 11 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It checks the same packages, 11 here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:21.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用时不到一毫秒，什么都不改：随时重跑都没问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in a fraction of a millisecond, and changes nothing: safe to re-run anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:25.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按之前说的，打开 venv 看看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Let's open the venv, as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:28.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条额外命令列出 bin 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This extra command lists its bin folder:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:31.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,python 软链接到 uv 下载的 Python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}python, a link to the Python uv downloaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:32.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,注意，没有 pip\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and, notice, no pip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:37.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有配置文件：home 是真正解释器的目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the config file: home is the real interpreter's folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:41.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,include-system-site-packages 是 false，prompt 是 app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}include-system-site-packages is false, and the prompt is app.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:44.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个部分，和画的一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All three parts, as drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:48.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 10 步：source .venv/bin/activate\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 10: source .venv/bin/activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:49.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:52.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提示符现在以 app 开头，外面带括号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your prompt now starts with app, in parentheses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:55.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的例子写的是 simple-translate\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's example says simple-translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:10:01.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但 uv 用项目名做提示符，pyproject.toml 里项目名是 app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But uv names the prompt after the project, and pyproject.toml calls it app.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:02.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,变了什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:07.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,激活之前，python 敲遍了 PATH 里的每扇门，什么也没找到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before activating, python knocked on every door in PATH and found nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:10.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 activate 脚本先存下旧的 PATH\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The activate script saves your old PATH,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:12.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再把 venv 的 bin 目录排到最前\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then puts the bin folder of the venv first,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:15.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这样在第一扇门就能找到 python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so python is found at the first door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:20.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查一下：which python 指向 .venv 里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Extra checks: which python points into .venv,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:25.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,python 报出的版本是 3.15.0，这是录制时的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and python reports 3.15.0, at the time of recording;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:27.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Debian 13 上是 3.13.5\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on Debian 13, 3.13.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 which pip 什么也没找到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And which pip finds nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:36.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 还有一个小错误：它说激活后 pip 会指向 venv\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Another small mistake in the README: it says activation points pip into the venv,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:37.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但 uv 建的 venv 根本没有 pip\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but a uv venv has no pip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.16,0:10:42.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果机器上有系统 pip，which pip 找到的就是它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On a machine with a system pip, which pip finds that one instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:44.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而它会拒绝安装，和一开始一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and it refuses, as at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:47.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要添加包，用 uv add\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To add a package, use uv add,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:51.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它还会把包记进 pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which also records it in pyproject.toml and uv.lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:55.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,激活还会设置一个叫 VIRTUAL_ENV 的环境变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Activation also sets a variable called VIRTUAL_ENV,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:11:00.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改提示符，再加一个 deactivate 命令，撤销这一切\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}changes the prompt, and adds a command called deactivate that undoes it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:04.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它只改变 shell 先去哪儿找，而且只在当前 shell 里有效\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It only changes where the shell looks first, and only in this shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:07.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要是 SSH 窗口重连了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If your SSH window reconnects,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:10.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就再 cd 进 simple-translate，重新激活\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}cd into simple-translate and activate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:14.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 11 步：同样跑三次，这次用不带 3 的 python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 11: the same three runs, now with plain python.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:19.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,长的两条从 README 复制，连引号一起，暂停一下，三条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Copy the long ones from the README, quotes included, and pause to run all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:23.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次 Google 正常回应了：这些是真实的译文\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This time Google answered: these are real translations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:28.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果又碰到 429，但看得到 Input 那一行，你的 venv 就没问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you get a 429 again but see the Input line, your venv works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:32.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个不用激活的额外办法，README 里都没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extras, not in the README, that skip activation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:37.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一，uv run python cli.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, uv run python cli.py syncs the venv if needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:39.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,需要时先同步 venv，再在里面运行应用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then runs the app inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:42.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,或者用路径调用 venv 的 python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Or call the venv's python by its path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:45.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么要 source，而不直接运行 activate 脚本？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And why source, not just run the activate script?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它根本不可执行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It isn't even executable,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:52.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就算当程序运行，也只改一个马上退出的子 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and run as a program, it would only change a child shell that exits at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:53.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跟 env 文件一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}like the env file.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:57.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们用几个额外命令来验证隔离\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Let's prove the isolation with a few extras.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:12:02.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先 deactivate：venv 激活的时候，连 python3 都指向它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Deactivate first: while the venv is active, even python3 points into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:06.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再让系统的 python3 去 import googletrans\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then ask the system's python3 to import googletrans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:08.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,报 ModuleNotFoundError\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}ModuleNotFoundError.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:12.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这台 VM 上，包只在 venv 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On this VM, the packages exist only in the venv.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:17.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在架子上看：系统 Python 从上到下扫一遍自己的列表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the shelves: the system Python scans its own list, top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:21.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 venv 的架子不在这个列表上，所以搜了个空\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The venv's shelf isn't on that list, so the search comes up empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:23.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在用 uv run 做同样的 import\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the same import through uv run,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:26.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,顺便打印这个 Python 认为自己在哪儿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}printing where this Python thinks it lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:29.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,能导入，打印的正是 .venv 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It works, and the answer is our .venv folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:32.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在假设你还留着第一部分的 VM\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now imagine you'd kept your part-1 VM.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:36.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同样 import，系统 python3，没有 venv。能导入吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same import, system python3, no venv. Does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.43,0:12:46.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,能：那台 VM 上，sudo pip 装的 googletrans\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yes: on that VM, sudo pip put googletrans
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:51.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在系统级的 /usr/local 架子上，每个程序都找得到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on the system-wide /usr/local shelf, so every program finds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:54.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同一个 import，架子不同，答案不同\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same import, different shelves, different answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:56.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,反过来也成立\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And it works the other way too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:58.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪怕在第一部分那台乱糟糟的 VM 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Even on that messy part-1 VM,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:02.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,venv 也会无视 sudo pip 装的一切\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a venv would ignore everything sudo pip put there,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:04.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为那些架子不在它的列表上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because those shelves aren't on its list.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:07.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,整节课的要点，就在这一张图里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the whole lesson in one picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:13.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个你会碰到的工具：pipenv，做同一件事的老办法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One more tool you'll meet: pipenv, an older way to do the same job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 的 pipenv 分支\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This repo's pipenv branch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:18.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是这个教程的旧版本，用的就是它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an older version of this tutorial, uses it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:20.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,单独的 AWS 版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So do the separate
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:24.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有后面 cheese app 的 API 服务，也都用它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}AWS version and, later, the cheese app's API service.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:26.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,思路一样，名字不同\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same ideas, different names.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:30.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 pyproject.toml 换成 Pipfile\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The pyproject.toml file becomes the Pipfile,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:33.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,uv.lock 换成 Pipfile.lock\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and uv.lock becomes Pipfile.lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:37.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,venv 放在你 home 目录下的某个目录里，而不是项目里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The venv lives in a folder in your home instead of in the project.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:42.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令 uv sync，换成 pipenv install 或 pipenv sync\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The command uv sync becomes pipenv install, or pipenv sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:47.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而激活换成了 pipenv shell：在 venv 里开一个新的 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And instead of activating, pipenv shell opens a new shell inside the venv.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 exit 就能退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type exit to leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:51.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们那个问题又来了，这次是真的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And here's our puzzle again, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:56.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那个分支的 lock 文件锁定的是 httpx 0.13.3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That branch's lock file pins httpx 0.13.3,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:14:03.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而我们的 uv sync 装的是 0.28.1，这是录制时的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}while our uv sync installed 0.28.1, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:07.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同一个应用的两个版本，两个版本的 httpx\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two versions of the same app, two versions of httpx.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:11.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在一个公用的系统 Python 里，它们没法共存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On one shared system Python, they couldn't live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,放在两个 venv 里，就可以\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In two venvs, they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:19.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 12 步：把 VM 连同启动磁盘一起删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 12: delete the VM, with its boot disk,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.18,0:14:23.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再确认 VM instances 和 Disks 页面都是空的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then check that VM instances and Disks are both empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:25.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在就暂停去删，免得忘了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and do it now, before you forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:27.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们小结一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:31.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这台 VM 给了我们一整台机器，能随便折腾，用完就删\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The VM gave us a whole machine that we can wreck and delete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:36.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 venv 把一个项目的包，和这台机器的 Python 隔开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The venv keeps one project's packages away from that machine's Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:39.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这两者之间，还能再加一层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And between the two, there's room for one more layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:42.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一层就是容器，下节课讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That layer is a container, and it's next lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:46.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,教程里的 Dockerfile 已经体现了这个思路\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tutorial's Dockerfile already shows the idea:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:48.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,复制代码，跑同样的 uv sync\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}copy the code, run the same uv sync,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:51.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后在激活了 venv 的 shell 里启动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and start in a shell with the venv activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:54.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天做的一切，都打包进一个镜像\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Everything you did today, baked into an image.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.23,0:14:57.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下节课有一件事要留意\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One thing to watch for next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:15:01.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 Dockerfile 用的是 Python 3.12 的镜像\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Dockerfile starts from a Python 3.12 image,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:04.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但项目要求 3.13 及以上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the project wants 3.13 or newer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:07.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,uv 会怎么处理，你已经知道了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You already know what uv will do about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:10.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后，留五道题给你自测\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you go, five questions to test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:13.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一题：--break-system-packages 这个参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One: what does the --break-system-packages flag
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到底破坏了什么，sudo pip3 把文件放到了哪儿？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}actually break, and where did sudo pip3 put the files?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:20.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二题：说出虚拟环境的三个部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two: name the three parts of a virtual environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:23.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三题：激活到底改了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three: what exactly does activation change,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.20,0:15:26.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不激活的话，有哪两种办法运行这个应用？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and what are two ways to run the app without it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:29.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第四题：2 个依赖变成了 11 个包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Four: 2 dependencies became 11 packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.85,0:15:32.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么会这样，哪个文件让每个人拿到同样的包？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why, and which file makes everyone get the same ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:36.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第五题：要求 Python 3.13 及以上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five: is requires Python 3.13 or newer a pin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:40.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,算不算 pin，怎样才能让版本确定下来？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and what would make the version deterministic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:42.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案在练习里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The answers are in the exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:45.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天的每条命令都在学习指南里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every command from today is in the study guide,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:47.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 MLOps Learning 这个 repo 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in the MLOps Learning repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:49.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下节课：容器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next time: containers.
